        "content": "## Setup before activating\n1. Import & activate **IT Ticketing - Error Notifier** first.\n2. Create Outlook folders: Filtered, NeedsReview, Processed/Open Tickets (+ Pending, Closed, Archive as needed).\n3. Open every **Move** node and reselect the correct folder (folder IDs are tenant-specific).\n4. Upload `IT Support Tickets.xlsx` to OneDrive/SharePoint; open every **Excel** node and reselect workbook + Tickets/ITTickets + Audit Log/AuditLog.\n5. Workflow Settings → **Error Workflow** → Error Notifier.\n6. Workflow Settings → **Concurrency** → `1`.\n7. Confirm Outlook Trigger watches Inbox and credentials are connected.\n8. Update self-send filter email in Extract node if mailbox differs.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
